Flint operator backend for FlashRT Structures

CUDA support and Tensor implementation adapted from FlashRT, Apache-2.0,
at the exact public revisions and paths recorded in sources.json.
Shared support is a pinned dependency snapshot for an independent binary;
canonical standalone CUDA files remain in FlashRT and are not moved.
Backend changes are maintained here; updates must refresh provenance and tests.

SageAttention-derived sources, FlashInfer and vLLM helper attribution and
applicable notices are preserved in flashrt_structures_flint/csrc/sage2.
Flint model/checkpoint ownership remains with RecursiveSI. vLLM owns the host
engine and optional prefill CUDA operators. CUTLASS and Triton retain their
upstream ownership and licenses. This package does not claim authorship of
the retained upstream code.
